    |  port1.0.10, switchport access vlan 10 (untagged)                 |
    |             switchport voice vlan 70 "ckVOICE"  (tagged)          |
    |  interface vlan10 10.38.22.34/27                                  |
    +------------------------------------------------------------------+
      | port1.0.2    | port1.0.16   | port1.0.4    | port1.0.14
      v              v              v              v
   swi_b p1.0.2   swi_b p1.0.16  swi_a p1.0.4   swi_a p1.0.14
   PASSIVE neighbours.  Not configured and not measured in this case.
   They appear in the `show lldp neighbors` output of STEP 4 and nowhere else.

  DUT     : swi_d (AT-x960-56YSQ) console u2 at 115200 baud, S/N A2WQS700B,
            chassis MAC e01a.ead4.7043.  Its LLDPDUs leave with source MAC
